<h3>The service</h3>

<p>
  Boolder is a bouldering guide for the Fontainebleau forest. The App gives free access to the area map, the list of problems, search and your saved problems, as well as the annotated photos of a selection of areas marked as free in the App.
</p>
<p>
  The Boolder Premium subscription additionally gives access to the annotated photos of all areas.
</p>
<p>
  The App does not require an account. Your saved problems are stored only on your phone.
</p>

